Family & What it does and observes & Knobs & Where \\\midrule
D2 & Adaptive claim markup that falls after a failed audit and recovers otherwise; own history & \const{7} & both tests; second test: headline only, and the six fresh markets in an exploratory follow-up after the report \\
D2+H3 & D2 with a searched option to replace the identity after a failed audit & \const{8} & both tests; second test: all seven markets \\
H2 & Sealed family written in a separate session; contains D2, no exit or re-entry & sealed & first test \\
X7-SC & State-conditioned: fresh, established, and terminal phases from its own audit exposure and pass count; reset or wait out a ban; voluntary exit & \const{15} & second test, all seven markets \\
X5-AG/v2 & Age-gated shading with the public constants & \const{7} & second test, all seven markets \\
H4 & Sealed, defence-aware, written after every defender was frozen; loaded once after the draw & at most \const{15} & second test, headline \\
W0, W1 & Welfare attacks on the D2+H3 and X7-SC knob spaces & as those & second test, headline \\
